                  "name": "Assign this role — integrated section",
                  "context": "DESIGN PROPOSAL /admin/roles/[id]: insert after Permissions, separate from Save role. Search by name/email; server-paginated results. Select multiple eligible users; selection persists across search and pages; Clear selection resets it. Already-assigned rows cannot be selected. Suspended accounts may receive the role but remain suspended. No selection disables Assign. Pending: show Assigning… and lock selection to prevent duplicate submission. Success: update assigned badges/count, clear successful selections, announce names/count. Failure: inline error by assignment action, retain selection, Retry assignment; partial success clears only successful IDs and lists failed names. Unsaved role edits: show Save role changes before assigning, disable assignment until saved or reverted. Assignment must add this role atomically without replacing other roles and recheck authorization server-side. No code implemented. Review: layout/contrast/operation checked by designing assistant; independent ui_validator and end_user_validator unavailable in this session.",
