                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Format selection never runs a job or navigates away. Keep uploads, card order and per-format settings. During processing, lock format controls; Cancel keeps sources and settings. On failure, show the reason and Retry.",
