    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "Rdc8L",
      "x": 141327,
      "y": -29752,
      "name": "Crop image / Interaction and recovery handoff",
      "clip": true,
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 720,
      "fill": "$surface",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 20,
      "padding": 32,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "wHqij",
          "name": "Heading",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1376,
          "content": "Crop image · interaction contract",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 26,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "u2qgpB",
          "name": "Operation model",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1376,
          "content": "Crop one raster image by moving and resizing a visible selection. The image owns the main workspace; persistent settings and the final generated-file actions belong in the right panel.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 16,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "o8fTBK",
          "name": "Flow",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1376,
          "content": "01 Add image → 02 Frame image → Crop image → 03 Download. Replace opens the file picker; cancelling keeps the current file. Reset crop restores the full-image selection. Adjust crop restores the source and last selection. Crop another image returns to 01.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "xqmuv",
          "name": "Direct manipulation",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1376,
          "content": "Eight 10 px handles with 44 px invisible hit targets. Drag inside to move; drag a handle to resize. Focused frame: arrows move 1 px, Shift + arrows 10 px. Numeric fields provide keyboard resizing. Constrain the selection to source bounds; all coordinates use source pixels, not preview pixels.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qLaR5",
          "name": "Settings and output",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1376,
          "content": "Ratio choices: Free / 1:1 / 4:3 / 16:9. Typing width or height releases the ratio lock with an inline notice. Output: Original / JPEG / PNG / WebP. Hide quality for PNG. JPEG warns that transparency becomes white. Dimensions must be positive; show inline errors and disable Crop image until valid.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "NsF8v",
          "name": "Recovery states",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1376,
          "content": "Unsupported file: “Choose a JPG, PNG or WebP image.” Oversize: “Choose an image under 25 MiB and 100 megapixels.” Keep the previous image on replacement failure. While running: “Cropping image…” and Cancel in the action area. Failure: “Could not crop this image. Your selection is saved.” with Retry. Cancel returns to the editor.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "SQMQy",
          "name": "Better UI implementation",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1376,
          "content": "Keep structural dividers. Image outline: 1 px pure black at 10% opacity. Shared buttons use 0.96 press scale; disable motion with reduced-motion/static behavior. No animated crop dragging or page-load entrance. Use one Lucide icon set, visible keyboard focus and shared tooltips. Download does not reset the selection.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "V00O0P",
          "name": "Verification scope",
          "fill": "$fg-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1376,
          "content": "Desktop canvas proposal; sample file facts are illustrative. Reviewed: problem fit, novice guidance, five-second scan, feedback and recovery. Live keyboard, pointer, motion and mobile behavior require implementation testing. Independent ui_validator and end_user_validator agents are not available in this tool session.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
