                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "z8W6r",
                  "name": "Admin: write, format, preview and publish an article. The primary object is editable rich text, not a metadata form. Use the large content canvas for paragraphs, headings, images, code, lists, quotes and tool links; keep author, category, URL and SEO in settings.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Admin: write, format, preview and publish an article. The primary object is editable rich text, not a metadata form. Use the large content canvas for paragraphs, headings, images, code, lists, quotes and tool links; keep author, category, URL and SEO in settings.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "gCxdn",
                  "name": "Public: find and read a useful guide, then open a relevant tool. A featured story anchors discovery; readable prose owns the article page. Keep the content measure around 65–75 characters with 18px body text and generous leading.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Public: find and read a useful guide, then open a relevant tool. A featured story anchors discovery; readable prose owns the article page. Keep the content measure around 65–75 characters with 18px body text and generous leading.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "m6UnI",
                  "name": "Admin routes",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Admin routes",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 22,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "myZx1",
                  "name": "/admin/blog → searchable, filtered post collection\n/admin/blog/new → create a draft, then replace URL with its ID\n/admin/blog/[id] → editor, settings, revision history\n/admin/blog/[id]/preview → authenticated draft preview",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "/admin/blog → searchable, filtered post collection\n/admin/blog/new → create a draft, then replace URL with its ID\n/admin/blog/[id] → editor, settings, revision history\n/admin/blog/[id]/preview → authenticated draft preview",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "s1ifB4",
