                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "dTb1O",
                  "name": "/blog → featured + latest published posts\n/blog?q=invoice&category=paperwork → URL-backed search / filters\n/blog/[slug] → current published revision only",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "/blog → featured + latest published posts\n/blog?q=invoice&category=paperwork → URL-backed search / filters\n/blog/[slug] → current published revision only",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "dWI7V",
                  "name": "List behavior",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "List behavior",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 22,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "XHlga",
                  "name": "Search title and author in admin; title, excerpt and body in public. Debounce 300ms; Enter submits immediately. Reset to page 1 when query or category changes. Preserve filters and scroll when returning from an article. Order the public index by publication date, search by relevance.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Search title and author in admin; title, excerpt and body in public. Debounce 300ms; Enter submits immediately. Reset to page 1 when query or category changes. Preserve filters and scroll when returning from an article. Order the public index by publication date, search by relevance.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "u4jlEi",
                  "name": "Counts in the examples",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Counts in the examples",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 22,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "tuh8h",
                  "name": "Before publishing: 18 admin posts = 14 published + 3 drafts + 1 scheduled. Six rows shown on desktop. Publishing the featured draft yields 15 public stories; homepage shows four. Search “invoice” has two matching published stories.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Before publishing: 18 admin posts = 14 published + 3 drafts + 1 scheduled. Six rows shown on desktop. Publishing the featured draft yields 15 public stories; homepage shows four. Search “invoice” has two matching published stories.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "hDGal",
              "name": "Writing and publication",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 22,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "AWluK",
                  "name": "02 / State & transition contract",
                  "fill": "$accent-text",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "02 / State & transition contract",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "lnI9r",
                  "name": "New post → private Draft. Autosave after 1 second idle and on blur; ⌘/Ctrl+S saves immediately. Status moves Saving → Saved with a timestamp. On network failure retain the current document and surface Retry save + Download draft; do not claim durable local storage.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "New post → private Draft. Autosave after 1 second idle and on blur; ⌘/Ctrl+S saves immediately. Status moves Saving → Saved with a timestamp. On network failure retain the current document and surface Retry save + Download draft; do not claim durable local storage.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "o9vMmC",
                  "name": "Preview first saves the current draft; blocked save offers Retry. The preview uses the exact article renderer at desktop or mobile width. Preview links are non-navigating, and it never appears in search engines or the public index.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Preview first saves the current draft; blocked save offers Retry. The preview uses the exact article renderer at desktop or mobile width. Preview links are non-navigating, and it never appears in search engines or the public index.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "BhXvB",
                  "name": "Review validates title, non-empty body, author, category and unique slug. Cover is optional; when present, alt text is required unless marked decorative. Publication checks are server-authoritative. Focus the first invalid field and keep all values.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Review validates title, non-empty body, author, category and unique slug. Cover is optional; when present, alt text is required unless marked decorative. Publication checks are server-authoritative. Focus the first invalid field and keep all values.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "WtVKB",
                  "name": "Publish now snapshots the saved revision. Button reads Publishing… and prevents duplicate submissions. On success show View live post, Copy link and Edit post. On failure stay in review with a retry; no partial public article.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Publish now snapshots the saved revision. Button reads Publishing… and prevents duplicate submissions. On success show View live post, Copy link and Edit post. On failure stay in review with a retry; no partial public article.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "w7LYvS",
                  "name": "Schedule requires a future date, time and explicit timezone. Freeze the selected revision. Later draft changes do not alter it; rescheduling shows the version being queued. Cancel returns to Draft. A failed job remains private and exposes Retry now / Reschedule.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Schedule requires a future date, time and explicit timezone. Freeze the selected revision. Later draft changes do not alter it; rescheduling shows the version being queued. Cancel returns to Draft. A failed job remains private and exposes Retry now / Reschedule.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ATyCl",
                  "name": "Editing a live post creates a draft revision. Use “Publish changes” for the final action. Restore history creates a new draft, never an automatic public rollback. Conflicts preserve both versions and offer comparison, export or a new private draft copy.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Editing a live post creates a draft revision. Use “Publish changes” for the final action. Restore history creates a new draft, never an automatic public rollback. Conflicts preserve both versions and offer comparison, export or a new private draft copy.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "jEUcD",
                  "name": "Unpublish confirms the public impact and returns content to Draft. Trash is allowed only after unpublishing / cancelling a schedule. Keep it restorable for 30 days; show its deletion date. Undo and Restore return to Draft, never to Published.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Unpublish confirms the public impact and returns content to Draft. Trash is allowed only after unpublishing / cancelling a schedule. Keep it restorable for 30 days; show its deletion date. Undo and Restore return to Draft, never to Published.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "lfGS4",
                  "name": "Media & rich content",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Media & rich content",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 22,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "sNxRj",
                  "name": "Proposed limits: JPG / PNG / WebP up to 10 MB. Show upload progress, retain the previous image until replacement succeeds, and provide retry. Image controls include alt text, caption, replace and remove. Code blocks have language selection and escaped text. No arbitrary executable HTML.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Proposed limits: JPG / PNG / WebP up to 10 MB. Show upload progress, retain the previous image until replacement succeeds, and provide retry. Image controls include alt text, caption, replace and remove. Code blocks have language selection and escaped text. No arbitrary executable HTML.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "dLBjD",
              "name": "Responsive, accessibility and build gates",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 22,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Ds4dS",
                  "name": "03 / Responsive & access",
                  "fill": "$accent-text",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "03 / Responsive & access",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 24,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "iCTjN",
                  "name": "≥1024px: editor canvas + 340px settings; public article body with sticky contents. 768–1023px: narrow article measure, contents above body; settings become a drawer. <768px: single-column discovery and explicit Write / Settings / Preview tabs. Keep primary actions at the end of each task and retain tab state.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "≥1024px: editor canvas + 340px settings; public article body with sticky contents. 768–1023px: narrow article measure, contents above body; settings become a drawer. <768px: single-column discovery and explicit Write / Settings / Preview tabs. Keep primary actions at the end of each task and retain tab state.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Y9Przy",
                  "name": "Mobile menu adds Blog without removing existing destinations. All categories remain available via filters. In preview, a 390px canvas represents phone reading. Long titles wrap; metadata, URLs and code never force the page wider.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Mobile menu adds Blog without removing existing destinations. All categories remain available via filters. In preview, a 390px canvas represents phone reading. Long titles wrap; metadata, URLs and code never force the page wider.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Mbq23",
                  "name": "Keyboard: semantic landmarks and headings, visible focus, skip-to-content link, toolbar labels via the shared tooltip system. The toolbar supports arrow-key navigation. Escape dismisses menus and dialogs; return focus to the trigger. Move blocks with buttons as well as drag.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Keyboard: semantic landmarks and headings, visible focus, skip-to-content link, toolbar labels via the shared tooltip system. The toolbar supports arrow-key navigation. Escape dismisses menus and dialogs; return focus to the trigger. Move blocks with buttons as well as drag.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "W0MAx4",
                  "name": "Announce saving, error, copied and published states with polite live regions. Errors use text plus icons, not color alone. Minimum 44px mobile control targets; preserve native text zoom. Respect reduced motion. Verify WCAG 2.2 AA in implementation, not from screenshots alone.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Announce saving, error, copied and published states with polite live regions. Errors use text plus icons, not color alone. Minimum 44px mobile control targets; preserve native text zoom. Respect reduced motion. Verify WCAG 2.2 AA in implementation, not from screenshots alone.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "pm1ib",
                  "name": "Security & implementation ownership",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Security & implementation ownership",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 22,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "gURpj",
                  "name": "Engineering: server-enforce admin authorization on every mutation and preview. Sanitize rich text and URLs; allow safe link schemes only. Public APIs, search and metadata must read published snapshots only. Use optimistic revision IDs for concurrency and an idempotent scheduling job.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Engineering: server-enforce admin authorization on every mutation and preview. Sanitize rich text and URLs; allow safe link schemes only. Public APIs, search and metadata must read published snapshots only. Use optimistic revision IDs for concurrency and an idempotent scheduling job.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "x3i5yO",
                  "name": "Product + Engineering: confirm rich-text schema/editor, scheduled job support, image storage/quotas, author management, category vocabulary, draft download format and 30-day retention before implementation. SEO fields fall back to title/excerpt; shared images fall back to cover.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Product + Engineering: confirm rich-text schema/editor, scheduled job support, image storage/quotas, author management, category vocabulary, draft download format and 30-day retention before implementation. SEO fields fall back to title/excerpt; shared images fall back to cover.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "LDXcp",
                  "name": "Review status / not an implementation claim",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Review status / not an implementation claim",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 22,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Q21BP",
                  "name": "Canvas review covers problem fit, novice feasibility, scanability and recovery using the actual screen sequence. Independent ui_validator and end_user_validator are configured in .codex/agents but cannot be launched by the tools exposed in this session. Their approval remains pending.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Canvas review covers problem fit, novice feasibility, scanability and recovery using the actual screen sequence. Independent ui_validator and end_user_validator are configured in .codex/agents but cannot be launched by the tools exposed in this session. Their approval remains pending.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "n5evo",
                  "name": "Runtime checks still required: focus order, keyboard editing, screen reader announcements, upload handling, public caching, permissions, publication atomicity, schedule timezone / DST, refresh and multi-admin conflict recovery.",
                  "fill": "$fg-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Runtime checks still required: focus order, keyboard editing, screen reader announcements, upload handling, public caching, permissions, publication atomicity, schedule timezone / DST, refresh and multi-admin conflict recovery.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
