                  "name": "Feedback & polish details",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "No card lift or stagger on routine browsing. Restrict hover to color/border feedback; honor reduced motion. Preserve existing system fonts, semantic colors and control radii. Counts come from the enabled catalog, not sample totals.",
