          "name": "Implementation delta and verification limits",
          "fill": "$fg-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Implementation delta: preserve category when submitting search on both routes; add query-preserving category navigation to Media. Reuse DevTools CategoryFilter rather than creating another select. Search pending and retry feedback are proposed requirements, not existing runtime behavior.\nVerification: static token contrast on white — primary text 17.40:1, secondary text 5.74:1, blue action text 4.83:1. Keyboard, screen-reader, 320px reflow, 200% zoom, RTL and reduced-motion checks require the implemented page. Canvas capture recovered after initial blank renders; the search and recovery examples are visually inspected, not runtime-tested.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
