        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "lDN3H",
          "name": "Flow mapping",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "SIGNED OUT  Logo + Search + hamburger → shared navigation.\nSIGNED IN  Logo + Search + [avatar + hamburger] → same navigation.\nCOMBINED CONTROL  Avatar and hamburger are one button, one focus stop.\nMENU OPEN  Hamburger becomes ×; signed-in avatar remains visible.\nSEARCH OPEN  Close navigation first; open existing WkgKD popover over page.\nMENU FROM SEARCH  Dismiss search first; open navigation, no autofocus.\nCLEAR  × inside search input clears query; popover stays open.\nDISMISS  Outside / Escape returns to closed state and trigger focus.\nAUTH  Sign in opens existing auth flow; successful sign-out restores guest header.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "gbagq",
          "name": "Implementation and accessibility notes",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Canonical header: A0gZB. Auth overrides: signed-out Didrt enabled, Dyz7e disabled; signed-in reverses them. Dyz7e references FcCau (avatar+menu), not an independent profile menu. Shared search WkgKD remains identical on desktop/mobile. Search is outside fIVCw. Keep 44px controls and 16px query text; prevent narrow-screen overflow without hiding navigation. Search/menu are mutually exclusive; opening menu must not summon keyboard. Keep user data out of guest view after sign-out.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "xb2er",
          "name": "Review scope",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Review scope: static mobile state designs and shared component references. Independent visual and end-user reviews requested. Native keyboard viewport, focus restoration, screen-reader announcements, navigation and authentication behavior require runtime implementation testing.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
