                      "fill": "$fg-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Narrow screen + keyboard",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-heading",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "aLL0k",
                      "name": "Contract details",
                      "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "PROPOSED MOBILE BEHAVIOR\n390px baseline; 320px uses the same single column with 16px gutters. Keep code at 16px on focus; scroll long lines inside the editor, never the page.\n\nKEYBOARD\nEditors and action stay in normal document flow; no fixed footer over the keyboard. Scroll focused line into view. Tab exits the editor. Dismissing keyboard restores full review space.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "oycuC",
                  "name": "Coverage + safety",
                  "width": 390,
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 12,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "F9yHOt",
                      "name": "Contract heading",
                      "fill": "$fg-primary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Coverage + safety",
                      "fontFamily": "$font-heading",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "600"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "AO7kb",
                      "name": "Contract details",
                      "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "REPRESENTATIVE, NOT EVERY ROUTE\nEditor → result covers formatting and conversion; paired inputs → result covers comparison. Generators, JWT and QR require their own surfaces.\n\nRECOVERY\nFailed repair keeps source editable. High-precision numbers block transforms; preserve source for export. Copy failure keeps the result selectable and offers retry.\n\nFEEDBACK\nCopy → “Copied” for 2 seconds, then resets. If clipboard access fails: “Couldn’t copy. Select the text or try again.”",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 13,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
