                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 16,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "MGIIv",
                  "name": "Live serializes {mode: \"live\", debounceMs: 120}. Debounce is optional; accept a finite non-negative integer. Manual serializes {mode: \"manual\", actionLabel}. Require a nonblank action label; omit debounceMs. Switching back restores the draft Live values.",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Live serializes {mode: \"live\", debounceMs: 120}. Debounce is optional; accept a finite non-negative integer. Manual serializes {mode: \"manual\", actionLabel}. Require a nonblank action label; omit debounceMs. Switching back restores the draft Live values.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "WobwG",
                  "name": "Capabilities: copy, download, cancel, progress, network each support Inherit / On / Off. Click an available switch to toggle; reset to Inherit through its keyboard-accessible help menu. Copy and download are true for JSON Formatter. Others are unset, not explicitly false.",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Capabilities: copy, download, cancel, progress, network each support Inherit / On / Off. Available switches toggle On/Off; the implementation must expose Reset to deployed in the capability group. Copy and download are true; others are unset, not explicitly false.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "cOo8M",
                  "name": "A capability cannot create worker or network support. Keep unavailable switches disabled with focusable explanation. Guard enabling against deployment metadata; never rewrite execution host or worker module through admin JSON.",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A capability cannot create worker or network support. Keep unavailable switches disabled with focusable explanation. Guard enabling against deployment metadata; never rewrite execution host or worker module through admin JSON.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "EfuvC",
                  "name": "layout: Inherit / side-by-side / stacked. workbenchMark: optional group; text plus tone Inherit / accent / contrast. Clearing the group removes it. Labels: empty, ready, running required; result optional.",
                  "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "layout: Inherit / side-by-side / stacked. workbenchMark: optional group; text plus tone Inherit / accent / contrast. Clearing the group removes it. Labels: empty, ready, running required; result optional.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
