                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "z8JeHK",
                      "name": "Blog AI assistant — whole article",
                      "context": "Whole-blog assistant available to manual and generated drafts. Plan & write opens existing idea composer; on a nonempty draft, defaults to creating a new draft, never overwrites it. Audit generates actionable findings, not an invented SEO score. Optimize proposes concrete changes from the current audit. Sources includes references, verification tasks and provider-backed originality scan. Ask assistant can request sections, examples, FAQs, titles, keywords and metadata. Every mutation is proposed, previewed and accepted explicitly, with Undo. Processing shows current task and Stop; failure preserves draft/request with Retry. Editing marks audit and scan outdated. Claim/source verification and originality require real connected services; never guarantee rankings or originality. Interaction designs: Th1Ro shows Audit click → running with Stop → findings → follow-up → preview → Accept/Discard → applied with Undo; failure retains draft/request with Retry. B8xrTV shows Plan & write, SEO optimization, originality consent, and stopped state. Quick actions create visible user messages in the same per-post thread, replacing the launch actions after first request. Scrolling keeps latest reply visible only if user is already at the bottom. Preserve history and draft revision on close/re-entry.",
