          "content": "ON RETRY → Disable Try again; label it “Trying…” and announce “Loading”.\nSuccess restores content. Zero total items → empty; zero filtered matches → no results.\nKeep search and filters when retrying. Clear filters resets both search and filters.\nFailure restores Try again. Keep cached content visible; show the shared error toast.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "id": "vuo8y",
          "type": "ref",
          "ref": "wm1rh",
          "name": "Retry pending / Disabled primary action",
