          "x": 40,
          "y": 1270,
          "name": "Excluded use heading",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1240,
          "content": "Where this component must not take over",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sGl2z",
          "x": 40,
          "y": 1320,
          "name": "Exclusion rules",
          "fill": "$fg-secondary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1240,
          "content": "FIELD VALIDATION → Keep the error beside the field, linked to its input.\nTRANSIENT FAILURE / CACHED DATA → Keep the content; use the shared error toast and preserve retry context.\nFILE INTAKE → Keep the real upload/drop surface, file constraints and selection action.\n403 / SUSPENDED → Keep AccessDeniedScreen: identity, permission, Switch account and checked-access feedback.\nGLOBAL CRASH → app/global-error.tsx needs a self-contained fallback; no provider or app-shell dependency.\nFORMULA / CODE ERROR → Keep the editable source, line or field location and actionable correction.\nUNCERTAIN BACKGROUND JOB → Keep generation progress; Refresh status checks the existing run before any retry.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "H1tZk",
          "x": 40,
          "y": 1602,
          "name": "Coverage footer",
