          "content": "Optional icon · required heading · optional explanation · 0–2 action slots · density: page / section / compact.\nHost owns handlers, permissions and busy state. Retry safe reads; never blindly replay a mutation or restart an uncertain job.\nContent determines height; actions wrap/stack. Use h1 for page replacement, scoped headings within panels; announce changes without stealing focus.",
