                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "P6IMWm",
                  "name": "Blog AI assistant — focused writing companion",
                  "context": "Whole-blog assistant available to manual and generated drafts. Plan & write opens existing idea composer; on a nonempty draft, defaults to creating a new draft, never overwrites it. Audit generates actionable findings, not an invented SEO score. Optimize proposes concrete changes from the current audit. Sources includes references, verification tasks and provider-backed originality scan. Ask assistant can request sections, examples, FAQs, titles, keywords and metadata. Every mutation is proposed, previewed and accepted explicitly, with Undo. Processing shows current task and Stop; failure preserves draft/request with Retry. Editing marks audit and scan outdated. Claim/source verification and originality require real connected services; never guarantee rankings or originality. Interaction designs: Th1Ro shows Audit click → running with Stop → findings → follow-up → preview → Accept/Discard → applied with Undo; failure retains draft/request with Retry. B8xrTV shows Plan & write, SEO optimization, originality consent, and stopped state. Quick actions create visible user messages in the same per-post thread, replacing the launch actions after first request. Scrolling keeps latest reply visible only if user is already at the bottom. Preserve history and draft revision on close/re-entry. Visual refresh: Linear Docs restrained navigation and shadcn sidebar grouping informed this design. Action rows use 40px desktop hit areas with 17px icons and 14px titles; 12px explanations. White panel, muted bottom composer, stable draft context. Header controls use shared tooltips on hover/focus. No action auto-applies edits. Checked at 1366×768 and 1280×720; conversation body alone scrolls at shorter heights. Repo ui_validator and end_user_validator execution blocked: agents are not exposed in this tool session.",
