          "content": "MANUAL: Configure → Generate → Completed. Edit settings creates a draft and expands the same form above the retained result. Cancel discards the draft. Generate with changes validates, replaces the result only on success, and returns to Completed.\nLIVE: Keep configuration expanded with the current result. Recompute after valid changes; no Generate step.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "OAy7p",
          "name": "Overflow contract",
          "fill": "$fg-primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Configuration uses rows of related fields, not a permanent narrow sidebar. Completed results use the full available width. Long results scroll within their renderer, keeping take-away actions visible. Wrap strings without inserting characters; copy and download preserve the literal output and its order.",
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "KSVNR",
          "name": "Shared feedback examples",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "height": 104,
          "fill": "$surface",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "kroxI",
              "type": "ref",
              "ref": "KYa0C",
              "name": "Invalid field pattern · applies to any schema field",
              "width": 420,
              "descendants": {
                "gasMG": {
                  "content": "Prefix (optional)",
                  "fontSize": 13
                },
                "bT9Rx": {
                  "stroke": "$danger-text"
                },
