          "context": "One universal generator, three modes: configure (settings-only compact form, no empty result), result (full-width output with applied settings summary), edit (same configuration expanded above retained previous result). This is the requested structural redesign, not the old two-pane workbench. Uses the existing DS controls/colors/fonts. Manual generation by default; live tools retain expanded configuration and update the result.",
