                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Same two points, two routes: the thin scenic arc and the heavy straight line drawn through it. Every utility here exists to be the chord, not the curve. The lens of empty space between them is the time you save.",
