      "context": "Current selected revision: restore earlier expression-first left workspace and persistent right-hand Settings. Large live meaning and five directly editable cron fields lead. Syntax help supports input; output reuses ERY94 result header, code surface and actions. No custom result bar. Timezone and command label remain in right settings. Live updates; Copy expression exports five fields; Download includes description/notes. Preset preserves notes. Code is not changed by this design revision.",
