                      "content": "Thumbnail: https://i.ytimg.com/vi/aqz-KE-bpKQ/hqdefault.jpg. Local design asset: assets/youtube-big-buck-bunny-source.jpg. Big Buck Bunny identifies the example source, not permission verification. All metadata and output figures are illustrative.",
