                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Revised in place: concise screen labels, canonical BlwMt single-select rows, 1366 × 768 / 1280 × 720 / 390 × 844 evidence, and audio/requested branches preserved. Fresh screenshots and visible-node clipping checks captured. Independent ui_validator + end_user_validator execution is BLOCKED: definitions exist, but no agent runner or codex executable is available here. Main session must run both before acceptance.",
