                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "E0gjI",
                      "name": "Selection behavior",
                      "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "BlwMt instances form one radio group. Entire row is clickable; arrows move selection, Space selects. Exactly one returned format ID is selected. Selected: accent-soft / accent / checked radio. Unselected: surface / border-strong / hidden radio dot. Default to 720p MP4 with sound when returned; otherwise select the first compatible file. Video and audio are mutually exclusive. A format change invalidates any prepared artifact.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.5,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 14,
