                      "name": "Screen copy moved to handoff",
                      "fill": "$fg-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Screen-copy policy: source title, duration, format, sound, quality/bitrate, output filename/size, brief status and next action only. Public-link and permission reminders remain visible. Link checks retrieve metadata on the server; source support is not guaranteed. No private, login-required or DRM-protected media. YouTube terms and creator rights apply. Quality/format availability comes only from the manifest, not thumbnail badges. Higher video resolution gives more picture detail; audio-only contains no picture. No upscaling or MP3 conversion is implied.",
